<!--
     SELF-CONTAINED dynamic participants report. Needs NO Java/backend changes: the two discipline
     subreports are compiled from the classpath via parameter default expressions, and the dynamic
     column headers are taken straight from the data ($F{disciplines} in the group header). So
     deploying = just uploading the .jrxml files to the templates store (MinIO) — no jar rebuild.

     The "Результаты окончательного профессионального отбора" columns are driven entirely by the
     per-candidate "disciplines" array (name/value, last entry is_total=true for the bold total).
-->
